      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\nRequirements Anoreth's bonded item is on their person\n\n---\nEffect Anoreth expends magical energy stored in their bonded item. During the current turn, they can cast one spell they prepared today and already cast, without spending a spell slot. They must still Cast the Spell and meet the spell's other requirements.",
