      "text": "Trigger A construct within 60 feet of Anoreth is damaged\n\n---\nEffect Anoreth clenches their fist, magically seizing the raw materials damaged by the triggering Strike and drawing it toward themself. These materials orbit Anoreth in a defensive ward, granting them 10 Temporary Hit points until the end of their next turn."
    },
