      "name": "Familiar",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Anoreth's familiar is a pipefox named Kiriki, who is usually in area D5. Kiriki has a Speed of 25 feet, climb Speed of 20 feet, darkvision, and the independent familiar ability. She otherwise functions as a pipefox."
